diff -ruN a/docs/research/spikes/softschema-kb/fsqlite/h3.ts b/docs/research/spikes/softschema-kb/fsqlite/h3.ts
--- a/docs/research/spikes/softschema-kb/fsqlite/h3.ts	1970-01-01 00:00:00.000000000 +0000
